  "description": "\"Something is lacking…\"\n\nIt's been about three days since I dumped my ex-boyfriend because I was sick of his rough and arbitrary sex style. Hyunwoo is regretting it.\n\nNow I have no choice but to admit it. Hyunwoo could no longer be satisfied with anything other than “that kind of sex.” I went to the second-hand trading site to sort out my troubled mind. Hyunwoo, whose mind was elsewhere, ends up saying something he shouldn't have said.\n\n“It was used by my ex-lover... .”\n\n“Your ex?”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5443000001), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/one_more), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=241221)",
